The image that docker/Dockerfile.train-cosmos3 builds contains:

- Cosmos3-Nano-Policy-DROID, from NVIDIA Corporation, under the OpenMDW License Agreement, version 1.1
  (OpenMDW-1.1). Copyright (c) 2026 NVIDIA CORPORATION & AFFILIATES. A copy of the agreement is at
  /opt/cosmos3/LICENSE-OpenMDW-1.1. The model card, with its notices of origin, is
  /opt/cosmos3/policy-model-card/README.md. The weights are at /opt/cosmos3/dcp, converted to a PyTorch
  distributed checkpoint. Positronic changed the file format only, not the weights.
- NVIDIA's Cosmos framework code, also under OpenMDW-1.1, in /workspace. Its LICENSE, NOTICE and
  ATTRIBUTIONS.md files are in /workspace.
- The Wan2.2 VAE (Wan2.2_VAE.pth) from Wan-AI/Wan2.2-TI2V-5B, under the Apache License 2.0. A copy of
  the licence is at /opt/cosmos3/LICENSE-Apache-2.0. The model card is /opt/cosmos3/wan22_vae/README.md.
- Positronic's scripts that start a training run, under the Apache License 2.0, in /opt/train. The
  licence is /opt/train/LICENSE.
